the Bible, Ecclesiastes 3:1.

00:01:35.574 --> 00:01:38.623
There's a time, a purpose
and a season for everything.

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:41.414
So evidently it's my time.

00:01:41.414 --> 00:01:43.363
It's his purpose.

00:01:44.351 --> 00:01:46.913
And it's our season,

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.870
you know, not too much to shine.

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:51.810
We have to understand and make sure

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:53.330
