00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:01.350
Don't do too much.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.400
Don't do too less.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:03.480
Do what's in front of you.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:07.600
