00:10:41.127 --> 00:10:45.280
I know gay people and it's okay,

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:47.080
because whatever you want to do in life

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.788
you're held accountable for it.

00:10:49.788 --> 00:10:51.807
My grandmother one told me, she said,

00:10:51.807 --> 00:10:52.887
"Sweetheart, let me tell you something.

00:10:52.887 --> 00:10:54.917
"If you have a thousand dollars

00:10:54.917 --> 00:10:58.807
"and you see a $500 suit, buy it.

00:10:58.807 --> 00:11:01.207
"But understand, make
sure your bills are paid

00:11:01.207 --> 00:11:03.710
"and everything else is done".

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:05.060
And I said, "Well, why?".

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:08.152
She said, "Because dammit,
you only live once.

00:11:08.152 --> 00:11:10.630
"And if you want that
damn $500 suit, buy it

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:12.650
because you never know, you
might leave here and say,

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:16.530
damn I never got a chance
to buy that nice suit

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:17.806
that I really wanted".

00:11:17.806 --> 00:11:20.890
So that's one of those
things that I look at.

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:21.850
- [Interviewer] And
there's no easy way out.

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:22.800
There's no shortcut to this.

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:23.633
- [Norman] No.

00:11:24.645 --> 00:11:26.487
- [Interviewer] You're
going to need courage.

00:11:26.487 --> 00:11:27.851
- [Norman] No.

00:11:27.851 --> 00:11:28.850
- [Interviewer] It takes courage.

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.225
Courage is like--

00:11:30.225 --> 00:11:31.058
- Yeah, it's like the 12 steps.

00:11:31.058 --> 00:11:33.120
They have principles behind the 12 steps.

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:36.140
It's honesty, hope, faith, courage,

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:38.200
integrity, willingness, humility,

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:41.590
love, forgiveness, discipline,
awareness, and service.

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:44.950
I have to put all of those in the act.

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.080
- [Norman] I bet your
courage would be the most.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.360
- Yeah and courage is, yes that's the one

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:52.740
because I may put on this male bravado

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:54.527
that, you know, "I'm a man".

00:11:54.527 --> 00:11:58.860
But deep down inside, I'm a
scared little kid, you know?

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:02.490
And, what I'm doing now is, is I'm leaning

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:06.412
and asking and trusting and
relying on God to push me

00:12:06.412 --> 00:12:09.847
into a state of mind, to where I says,

00:12:09.847 --> 00:12:11.017
"You know what?

00:12:11.017 --> 00:12:14.187
"Once I have a problem, anything,

00:12:14.187 --> 00:12:15.733
"I don't have to run anymore.

00:12:16.647 --> 00:12:19.017
"All I got to do is open my mouth.

00:12:19.017 --> 00:12:20.747
"Lord, I'm having a problem here.

00:12:20.747 --> 00:12:22.290
"Could you direct me?".

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:26.015
And I've never done that because
I had a problem with God.

00:12:26.015 --> 00:12:28.683
We don't have a problem anymore.

00:12:29.814 --> 00:12:34.814
We're tight because see,
I seek him every day.

00:12:35.546 --> 00:12:36.860
I seek him every day.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:39.160
And that's what really catapults me

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:40.460
into this state of mind, you know.

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:42.027
Some people might, you know,

00:12:42.027 --> 00:12:44.153
"Well, you know, don't let
your ego get in the way".

00:12:44.153 --> 00:12:47.053
Okay, that's understandable.

00:12:49.373 --> 00:12:51.160
But he's my employer.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:56.160
Even though I have a new job,
I also have a bigger job.

00:12:57.680 --> 00:12:58.883
He's my employer.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:00.723
I'm his employee.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:05.865
At some point in time, even through this

00:13:05.865 --> 00:13:08.740
there's going to come
a point where somebody

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.820
is going to be put in front of me.

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:12.023
My job is to help them.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.880
My job is not to look down as anybody,

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:17.330
whether they're an addict

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:21.330
whether they have mental deterioration,

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:25.640
whatever it is, my job is
not to look down at them.

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:27.810
My job is to look at them

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:31.530
and extend my hand and pick them up.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:32.900
That's my job.

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:34.790
That's what I have to do.

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:38.063
Otherwise I'm wasting time.

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:42.180
I'm wasting quality
smoking time, as they say.

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:43.530
So I don't want to do that.

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:46.560
I'm just going to take it a day at a time.

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:48.150
- [Interviewer] So you
start work this week?

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:48.983
- Yes.

00:13:48.983 --> 00:13:53.200
And I'm excited about it.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:57.523
You know, I've never
worked in a grocery store,

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:01.678
but it's gonna be fun, you know.

00:14:01.678 --> 00:14:02.940
I like to eat,

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.380
so, you know, I'm not saying

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:05.560
I'm going to run around the grocery store

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:07.655
and eat up everything, but it's new.

00:14:07.655 --> 00:14:10.938
And I embrace newness today.

00:14:10.938 --> 00:14:15.420
The fear of the unknown
is starting to dissipate

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:19.100
because usually if I
can't touch it, taste it,

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:21.300
feel it and see it, I
ain't fucking with it.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:27.750
But God works in the unknown for me.

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:29.900
I don't know what God
does for anybody else,

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:33.305
but he works in the unknown
and he works in the unseen.

00:14:33.305 --> 00:14:35.513
I'm beginning to know him.

00:14:37.788 --> 00:14:40.893
And for me, this is just my own opinion,

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:44.113
I see him.

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:48.433
I see him when I look in the mirror,

00:14:50.131 --> 00:14:54.350
the path that I'm on, what I'm doing,

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:57.313
my mindset, that's God, not me.

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:01.701
Yeah, some one person
wrote a comment and said,

00:15:01.701 --> 00:15:04.050
"Hey, you know it's just
not about God, it's you".

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:06.310
Well, if I didn't have the fortitude,

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:09.230
the wherewithal and
the empowerment of God,

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.860
fuck it, dude, I'm through, you know?

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:13.400
Yeah, you can cancel Christmas.

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:15.831
Santa's not coming, it's over.

00:15:15.831 --> 00:15:20.831
So it's going to be,
it's going to be good.

00:15:22.145 --> 00:15:24.043
You know, I'm enjoying it.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:29.460
I haven't faced any major challenges yet.

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:31.000
I know they're coming.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.353
Life has peaks, valleys, rivers,

00:15:33.353 --> 00:15:37.098
oceans of disparity, depression.

00:15:37.098 --> 00:15:42.098
I'm learning how to swim
in the ocean of life.

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:47.210
I'm learning how to tread water
in the river of disparity.

00:15:48.490 --> 00:15:51.260
Most importantly, God has placed me

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:56.104
