that's what's propelling me.

00:15:56.104 --> 00:15:57.403
That's what's going to be good.

00:15:58.630 --> 00:15:59.897
- [Interviewer] I wish
you the best of luck.

00:15:59.897 --> 00:16:01.570
You're doing a great job so far.

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:02.403
- [Norman] Okay.

00:16:02.403 --> 00:16:03.520
Yes, sir, we'll take it one day at a time.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:04.353
Everybody out there,

00:16:04.353 --> 00:16:05.690
